# #189 Piece 2 (disc 508) — a real project MISSING crl.canonicalBase
library "No Base Coverage".

/*
The project's package.json declares NO `crl.canonicalBase`, so a local concept's
`{system, code}` set is UNDERIVABLE. An AUTHORED-code local fact then cannot have its
membership computed; the CRE fails the run LOUD (fabrication-refusal) rather than guess
— matching the emitter, which also refuses to compose the local CodeSystem url (#271).
A BARE fact still evaluates (degenerate presence; no system needed).
*/

concept "Skull Fracture":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `skull-fracture`.
- definition is exists this.

decision "Coverage Determination":
first:
- when "Skull Fracture" then recommend activity "deny.skull".
- otherwise then recommend activity "approve".

activity "deny.skull":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Excluded: skull or vertebral fracture.`.

activity "approve":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
- with `Approve coverage.`.
